cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalog, please cite it as below."
title: "Economics Journal Geographic Dispersion — article catalog, 2012–2025"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Yu"
    given-names: "Chiuyu"
    alias: "kochiuyu"
    affiliation: "The Chinese University of Hong Kong"
abstract: >
  Public TOC-first article catalog for the Geographic Dispersion
  core 49 economics journals, 2012–2025: titles, DOIs, issues,
  research vs non-research typing, and author names as printed
  in the publisher TOC or, when the TOC has no names, from
  OpenAlex (name only). Internal person identifiers, conflict
  files, and QS handoffs are not included.
keywords:
  - economics
  - journals
  - articles
  - table of contents
  - geographic dispersion
license: CC-BY-4.0
